Firmware can be pushed to SCEPTRE bennu field devices again (``peat push -d sceptre -t firmware``). PEAT refuses to push firmware that ``bennu-watcherd`` wouldn't install, because it doesn't match the hashes the watcher accepts. Pulls now report ``bennu-field-deviced.firmware`` as the device firmware only if the watcher accepts it, otherwise the original ``bennu-field-deviced`` binary.
